The main change in this scenario is that for low \MZP, the decay branching ratio of the both the SM Higgs and \HH 
to $\ZP$ is significant, and the leptons from the $\ZP$ decay appear in the fiducial phase space of several measurements. 
Of course, the ATLAS and CMS measurements of Higgs properties,
which are not used by \textsc{Contur}, would also rule out some of these scenarios.



